{"id":232,"flavor":[{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"If Donphan were to tackle with its hard body, even a house could be destroyed. Using its massive strength, the Pokémon helps clear rock and mud slides that block mountain trails."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Donphan’s favorite attack is curling its body into a ball, then charging at its foe while rolling at high speed. Once it starts rolling, this Pokémon can’t stop very easily."},{"games":["Y","SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"The longer and bigger its tusks, the higher its rank in its herd. The tusks take long to grow."},{"games":["X","HeartGold","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"It has sharp, hard tusks and a rugged hide. Its Tackle is strong enough to knock down a house."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It attacks by curling up then rolling into its foe. It can blow apart a house in one hit."},{"games":["FireRed"],"text":"The longer and bigger its tusks, the higher its rank in its herd. The tusks take a long time to grow."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"A DONPHAN is so strong it can easily haul a dump truck. Its hide has toughened to a rock-hard state. An ordinary sort of attack won’t even leave a scratch."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"Because this POKéMON's skin is so tough, a normal attack won't even leave a scratch on it."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Sturdy","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon cannot be knocked out by a single hit as long as its HP is full. One-hit KO moves will also fail to knock it out."},{"name":"Sand Veil","hidden":true,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's evasiveness in a sandstorm."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"rough terrain","color":"Gray","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":231,"name":"Phanpy","condition":null,"children":[{"id":232,"name":"Donphan","condition":"Lv. 25","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[0,